      "text": "__           _     __    __           _     _\n / /  ___  ___| |_  / / /\\ \\ \\___  _ __| | __| |\n/ /  / _ \\/ __| __| \\ \\/  \\/ / _ \\| '__| |/ _` |\n/ /__| (_) \\__ \\ |_   \\  /\\  / (_) | |  | | (_| |\n\\____/\\___/|___/\\__|   \\/  \\/ \\___/|_|  |_|\\__,_|\n002 - iaakki - physics codes updated, frametimer added\n003 - iaakki - most of the ssf sounds included; lot still missing\n004 - bord - tuned insert brightness for 10.8 beta 6\n005 - TastyWasps - Fleep sounds, VR integration, Dynamic Ball Shadows, script organization\n006 - TastyWasps - Desktop Digits, VR Deluxe Room\n007 - TastyWasps - VR Backglass updated from Hauntfreaks\n008 - bord - incorporate Wylte physics feedback, minor visual tweaks\n009 - iaakki - physics change for top lane nails, bumper ring speed increased slightly, minor change to sling rubber, ball release sound added, lowered zcol_posts falloff to 0.05 as Wylte proposed\n      Upped flipper elasticity and zcol_rubbers friction\n010 - bord - bumper base visuals tweak, refraction reduction, siderails added to DT\n011 - iaakki - bumpers chopped\n012 - TastyWasps - VR cab art upscaled by DGrimmReaper/DarthVito\n013 - TastyWasps - VR cab art upscaled by Hauntfreaks / DGrimmReaper\n014 - TastyWasps - visible tag fixed on VR Deluxe room book object.\n015 - bord - cleanup for release"
